sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Client
    participant B as Load balancer
    participant C as Server
    A->>C: A rather long request description that crosses the load balancer lifeline
    C-->>A: Short
    A->>B: health check with a moderately long label
    B->>B: self check with an even longer label to the right
    B-->>A: OK
    Note over A,C: A note spanning all three participants, with enough text to wrap onto a second line when it gets long
    A-xC: Cancel
    A->C: plain line, no head
    A-->C: dotted line, no head
